# WeatherBoard Environment Variables (Optional)
# The dashboard runs 100% functional out-of-the-box using Open-Meteo as the free, keyless data source.
# If you have your own API keys, add them here:

# OpenWeatherMap API Key (free tier: https://openweathermap.org/api)
# When set, OpenWeatherMap is queried first with Open-Meteo as automated fallback.
VITE_OWM_API_KEY=

# GeoDB Cities API Key via RapidAPI (free tier: https://rapidapi.com/wirefreethought/api/geodb-cities)
# When set, GeoDB is used for city autocomplete with Open-Meteo Geocoding as automated fallback.
VITE_GEODB_API_KEY=
